<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">I understand and I'm grateful for the opportunity. I think of it as three months because I know my work ethic but if it doesn't work out that way, it's never a problem for me, but I appreciate the need to clarify. Hope you have a good summer
 also!</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
