<p class="x_MsoNormal">Hi there Sam,</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">I will be talking with Mary and Michelle later this afternoon about the position.
</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">Sounds like you have a full summer season ahead of you! I wanted to reiterate that we have you for the months of October and November, but I do not have you on the schedule for December as I had initially just guaranteed those first two
 months with the <i>possibility</i> of adding a third dependent on openings and the new OPRD policy of manager approval needed for 3 months. Remember that typically we only offer one trial month for new hosts to our specific host program, but since you came
 with a good recommendation, I added you for 2! </p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">Enjoy your summer and travel plans between now and your time hosting with us.</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
