<p class="x_MsoNormal">Hey Paiute,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">Hope you're awesome. <span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif">
&#128579;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">I just wanted to let you know some volunteer friends here at Honeyman are thinking about applying for this position - Mary and Michelle. They are awesome people and very hard working so if you hear from them, I hope my endorsement carries
 the smallest amount of weight toward picking them!</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">Also my friend John will be at Beverly Beach in April and May. Please take care of him - he's a solid worker who cares about the parks. I know he'll be an asset to you.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">I'll be at Umpqua next month - can't wait to see Franki again!! Then Mount Doom (Humbug Mountain) for two months. Then two months of travel across the country. Then Tugman in September. Then three months in your wonderful environment!
 So excited.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">Take care!</p>
</div>
